      "content": "it's just my back though... i'm not a doctor and i really think i just strained it lifting those boxes. i can't afford an urgent care visit right now. if i just take the 800mg and use a heating pad, what's the worst that could happen? surely it's just a muscle thing and it'll settle down by morning if i just rest it.",
